{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219390/extras/78b1e767e53d1cef6764bd986386f2eb.poster.avif?t=1759190366\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219390/extras/78b1e767e53d1cef6764bd986386f2eb.webm?t=1759190366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219390/extras/78b1e767e53d1cef6764bd986386f2eb.mp4?t=1759190366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vibrant picturesque world as you search for a number of strange artifacts needed to save your friend, and perhaps the world? Delve into dungeons, overcome obstacles, solve puzzles, and fight foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219390/extras/2e1d8f02cadeca32ceb9265283e039f3.avif?t=1759190366\" width=1170 height=109 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vibrant picturesque world. From a grand port city to the west, to a dangerous desert in the east. Snow-covered mountained up north, and deep dangerous forests to the south.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into a number of dungeons in search for unique items and special artifacts, while overcoming obstacles, solving puzzles, and fighting foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A seemingly insignificant story that develops into something much bigger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across the world in a number of ways, including a steaming locomotive!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full dynamic day / night cycle with various dynamic weath